{"title":"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The length of a rectangle is three times its width. If the length is decreased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and the width is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the rectangle becomes a square. Determine the length of the original rectangle.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> be the original width of the rectangle, meaning that the original length of the rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/e/0ce3fe965a1d829cbdd8c35441b11687e90a7ce8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"14\" />. A square has equal width and length, so increasing the width by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and decreasing the length by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> giving a square means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/f/8ef2e21a4011c5f5b6c1d8e97def895ed782292c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3w - 5 = w + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/1/0d12e87cbda90e72e764b828c36bf027f7d923f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3w - w = 5 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/0/9c03bc22109cb22e976969cba3e7cfb8d4ce671f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2w = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/3217d6b96341ab553eec89a8a5ecbf4c1431f80c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w = \\boxed{10}{2} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"111\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>The original length of the rectangle is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7d97a268ef531e75d99b8a87b8126cdfc0cb06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 5 = \\boxed{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"96\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28No_Variables.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(No_Variables)\">Solution 2 (No Variables)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (No Variables)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since decreasing the length by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and increasing the width by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> resulted in a square, which has equal width and length, the original length must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/9/d8960273de80b2fbf705fe447a3ba0ce9b83946f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> more than the original width. We then realize that this means that the original length is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/b/59b27f34837a274441190f55a2b7690ab1261519.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> since the original width would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and increasing the width by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> there gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/9/d8960273de80b2fbf705fe447a3ba0ce9b83946f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> and decreasing the length by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gives the same thing. \n</p><p>Thus, the original length is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f73a8dcb8bba5c7529a6cded96fa1226d78e7dae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC\" title=\"2012 CIMC\">2012 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018055243\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 145/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1289/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 140/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3534/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.805      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    8.805      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37055:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018055243 and revision id 286267. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}